<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.3.4">
<l>kātam palavun tirintuḻaṉ ṟēṟkaṅkōr niḻalillai nīrillaiyuṉ</l>
<l>pāta niḻalallāl maṟṟō ruyirppiṭam nāṉeṅkuṅ kāṇkiṉṟilēṉ</l>
<l>tūtuceṉ ṟāykuru pāṇṭavark kāyaṅkōr poycuṟṟam pēciceṉṟu</l>
<l>pētañcey teṅkum piṇampaṭait tāytiru māliruñ cōlaiyentāy</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>For me who wandered, whirling about for many miles,</l>
<l rend="indent">there is no shade, there is no water,</l>
<l rend="indent">except the shade of your feet,</l>
<l>I do not see anywhere another place of refuge.</l>
<l>You who came as a messenger, as the Pāṇḍavas’ guru,</l>
<l rend="indent">speaking of false kinship</l>
<l>You, my father of Tirumāliruñcōlai, sowing discord,</l>
<l rend="indent">created corpses everywhere.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
